  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_039) achieve the highest accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests replacing scvi_n200 with pca_n2000 RNA encoder while keeping other components the same, to evaluate if this alternative encoder could further improve performance. It clarifies the impact of RNA encoder choice on accuracy, balancing exploration of new encoders with exploitation of the current top-performing architecture."
